'''Toying Around''' (おもちゃのチャチャチャ, ''Omocha no Chachacha'', '''Toy's Cha Cha Cha''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]].

==Effect==
Accounting Power UP (Sm): Money gained when defeating an enemy increases by 10%.

